       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-20-MAX-MIN-FUNCTIONS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC S9(4) VALUE -5.
01 B PIC S9(4) VALUE 9.
01 C PIC S9(4) VALUE 2.
01 X PIC S9(4).
01 Y PIC S9(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COMPUTE X = FUNCTION MAX(A, B, C)
COMPUTE Y = FUNCTION MIN(A, B, C)
DISPLAY X
DISPLAY Y
STOP RUN.
